# RUCHI — environment variables
# Copy to .env.local and fill in if you want AI-assisted help answers and copy.
# The app is fully functional without any keys: it uses the deterministic
# matching engine and the structured help library.

# ── AI provider (choose one) ────────────────────────────────
# Provider is selected automatically from whichever key is present.
# Order: openai → anthropic → none (deterministic fallback).

# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional: force a provider instead of auto-detect
# AI_PROVIDER=openai | anthropic | none
